-- title:
--   Ideals of a Noetherian local ring are contracted from the completion
-- statement:
--   Let $S$ be a commutative ring that is Noetherian and local, with maximal ideal $\mathfrak m =$ `IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal S`, and let $\mathfrak a$ be an ideal of $S$. Write $\widehat S =$ `AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal S) S` for the $\mathfrak m$-adic completion of $S$, regarded as an $S$-algebra via the canonical structure map. The theorem asserts that the preimage under `algebraMap S` $\widehat S$ of the ideal generated by the image of $\mathfrak a$ in $\widehat S$ is again $\mathfrak a$; that is, the composite of extension of ideals along $S \to \widehat S$ followed by contraction back to $S$ is the identity on $\mathfrak a$, or in the classical notation $\mathfrak a \widehat S \cap S = \mathfrak a$. No hypothesis on $\mathfrak a$ beyond being an ideal is imposed, and the statement is an equality of ideals of $S$ (not merely the inclusion $\mathfrak a \widehat S \cap S \subseteq \mathfrak a$, the reverse inclusion being formal).
--
--   This is the standard consequence of the faithful flatness of the $\mathfrak m$-adic completion of a Noetherian local ring: ideals are contracted along a faithfully flat ring extension. It is used to transfer membership in explicitly given ideals of a local ring back from its completion, in the analysis of the crossing models at the nodes of the modular curve and the associated Igusa branches.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_Ideal_comap_map_adicCompletion_eq_of_isNoetherianRing.lean

import Mathlib

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

set_option autoImplicit false

theorem Ideal.comap_map_adicCompletion_eq_of_isNoetherianRing
    {S : Type*} [CommRing S] [IsNoetherianRing S] [IsLocalRing S] (𝔞 : Ideal S) :
    (𝔞.map (algebraMap S (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal S) S))).comap
        (algebraMap S (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal S) S)) = 𝔞 := by sorry
